# cx3: even loop, one target
#
# From Appendix B of stable_semantics_plan.md; TestStableModels (stable_models_test.go) checks the same case
# and TestStableModelsFiles checks that this file matches it. Run it with
#   shawell -l -i -s resources/stable_models/cx3.ttl -m <semantics>
# Expected verdicts (exit codes):
#   well-founded     invalid (3)
#   stable-brave     valid (0)
#   stable-cautious  invalid (3)

@prefix : <http://example.org/> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

# data
:a :q :b .

# shapes
:A a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetNode :a ; sh:not :B .
:B a sh:NodeShape ; sh:not :A .

